  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed Rockpanel cladding on the Clarence Street front elevation, due to its appearance and siting, would be an incongruous addition to the host building resulting in adverse impacts on the character and appearance of the streetscence and surrounding area, contrary to Paragraph 135 of the National Planning Policy Framework 2024, Policy D3 of the London Plan 2021, and Policy DM10 of the Council's Core Strategy 2012."
  ],
